Package: nomadforms
Type: Package
Title: Offline-Capable Survey Toolkit for Field Research
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Nichodemus", "Amollo", email = "nichodemuswerre@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Tools for building offline-capable survey data collection
    workflows for field research in low- and middle-income countries.
    Provides survey question rendering helpers, skip logic with JavaScript
    transpilation, response validation, 'REDCap' codebook import,
    internationalization with built-in translations, geolocation and
    multimedia capture helpers, and data export to 'Stata', 'SPSS', Excel,
    CSV, and JSON formats.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    DBI,
    jsonlite,
    htmltools,
    utils
Suggests:
    RPostgres,
    shiny (>= 1.7.0),
    haven,
    openxlsx,
    plumber,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/gondamol/nomadforms
